                        "version": 0,
                        "content": "The nurse is caring for a client who was recently diagnosed with primary open-angle glaucoma (POAG). Which assessment finding is specific to this type of glaucoma?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nPOAG results from obstruction to outflow of aqueous humor and is the most common type. Assessment findings include painless vision changes and \"tunnel vision.\" Primary angle-closure glaucoma (PACG) is another type of glaucoma that results from blocking the outflow of aqueous humor into the trabecular meshwork. Assessment findings include blurred vision, ocular erythema, and halos around lights.",
                        "id": "08b107fe6dd74ab984956ee4e0572346",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "8eda0854705a432faa2a9def14dc2035",
                                "content": "Avoid overuse of the eyes."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "a2421e06c78c4943903b953e8084c242",
                                "content": "Decrease the amount of salt in the diet."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "e5d3760daee147209d4b88d80e592749",
                                "content": "Eye medications will need to be administered for life."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "fe4eff858882467c888d4fbb63149291",
                                "content": "Decrease fluid intake to control the intraocular pressure."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "8eda0854705a432faa2a9def14dc2035",
                                    "content": "Avoid overuse of the eyes."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "a2421e06c78c4943903b953e8084c242",
                                    "content": "Decrease the amount of salt in the diet."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "e5d3760daee147209d4b88d80e592749",
                                    "content": "Eye medications will need to be administered for life."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "fe4eff858882467c888d4fbb63149291",
                                    "content": "Decrease fluid intake to control the intraocular pressure."
                                }
