                        "content": "The nurse is developing a teaching plan for a client with glaucoma. Which instruction would the nurse include in the plan of care?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nThe administration of eye drops is a critical component of the treatment plan for the client with glaucoma. The client needs to be instructed that medications will need to be taken for the rest of their life. Options 1, 2, and 4 are not accurate instructions.",
                        "id": "11a40a08fd704bb9b481663ace111aa8",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "32e5a602671c4b0c8e059959393514a7",
                                "content": "Apply normal saline drops."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "28d2ddd55798476dbf2c90152d4665ce",
                                "content": "Note the time of day the test was done."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "b59a93c7d5824c7090811ba95c6ec94f",
                                "content": "Contact the primary health care provider (PHCP)."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "a1a261c60ee64ef59d11534f244b32f9",
                                "content": "Instruct the client to sleep with the head of the bed flat."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "32e5a602671c4b0c8e059959393514a7",
                                    "content": "Apply normal saline drops."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
