                        "content": "The nurse is caring for a client in the postoperative period following enucleation. The nurse notes bloody staining on the surgical eye dressing. Which nursing action is most appropriate?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nAfter enucleation, if the nurse notes any staining or bleeding on the surgical dressing, the surgeon needs to be notified immediately. The remaining options are not appropriate nursing actions for this client.",
                        "id": "352361046c104bf9a1bf5cb870b55d27",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "9b24d314d72c458f90162c8a2b163aaf",
                                "content": "I need to sleep on my left side."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "741e4820a84940c397fe545dca6e5fc0",
                                "content": "I would sleep on my right side."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "4133682fdb954dc39f242bd8f86b6b19",
                                "content": "I would sleep with my head flat."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "a7666a302d4641e5a6fe6c643c4829a6",
                                "content": "I would not wear my glasses at any time."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "9b24d314d72c458f90162c8a2b163aaf",
                                    "content": "I need to sleep on my left side."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "741e4820a84940c397fe545dca6e5fc0",
                                    "content": "I would sleep on my right side."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "4133682fdb954dc39f242bd8f86b6b19",
                                    "content": "I would sleep with my head flat."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "a7666a302d4641e5a6fe6c643c4829a6",
                                    "content": "I would not wear my glasses at any time."
                                }
                            ]
