                        "content": "A client is diagnosed with glaucoma. Which piece of nursing assessment data identifies a risk factor associated with this eye disorder?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nHypertension, cardiovascular disease, diabetes mellitus, and obesity are associated with the development of glaucoma. Options 2, 3, and 4 do not identify risk factors associated with this eye disorder.",
